5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to fix the fee structure before choosing a location.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Last year’s sleep quality was unacceptable. I want to check the lodging details.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the workload for the organizers this time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The budget gap from last year is still there. I need to see the costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,The year groups are isolated. We need a place that forces interaction.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, what specific cost data are you looking for?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
