12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I just want to make sure we don't burn out the team again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I am checking the transport receipts and the public bed rates.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I will look at what the seniors say about mixing and the attendance sheets.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
