16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look at the accounts from inland clubs and the prefecture rate sheet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the lottery application and the vacation timetable for our hall.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also look at the group transport receipts from the last three years.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the membership list against first-train times and the senior comments.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let's see what the data says before we commit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,The data will tell us if the nights are viable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the application process isn't too complicated.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will keep the numbers strict. No hidden costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
