35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. That's a risk for late dropouts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Inland clubs slept eight to a room with lights out at eleven. That's brutal.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The public booking lottery is six months out and the application is nine pages.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Transport was 38% of the cost when we went far. That's a huge chunk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Seniors say mixing only happens in the evenings if we sleep together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, eight to a room sounds like a disaster for recovery.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, yes. But the rate sheet says 1,100 yen covers hall use too.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, if transport is that high, maybe we should stay local?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, staying local might save transport, but the hall is booked by others.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,A third of the club can't be on campus by nine without a bed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The canteen closes, so we'd have to cook. That's two hours a day.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,Cooking duty is a burden. I want a place with kitchen staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The vacation timetable for our hall is full. We can't get a continuous block.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,So the campus option is out if we want a proper block.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we go inland, we need to ensure the rooms aren't overcrowded.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The coastal lodge offers its own building. That solves the cooking issue.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,But it's two prefectures away. Transport costs will be high.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"The application for the public centre is a hassle, but it's cheaper.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I need to balance the cost against the quality of the stay.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"The coastal lodge might be the best for mixing, if we can afford it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
